# Synthetic data & results ARE committed (see data/raw, data/processed,
# results/logs) so the hosted Streamlit dashboard shows real numbers out of
# the box — all synthetic, no real people. Only the stale/legacy secondary
# plots dir stays ignored; the live dashboard regenerates its own charts.
results/plots/*.png
results/plots/*.pdf

# Unpublished thesis documents — this repo is public; never auto-stage these.
*.docx
*.doc
*.pdf
~$*
!WALKTHROUGH.docx
